AX_Settings

Based on the settings UI of WaypointUI by AdaptiveX, licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3. AX_Settings is distributed under the same licence (see LICENSE).
Named in honour of AdaptiveX (AX).

Built on AX_Modules, the toolkit extracted from the same addon (its own folder, with its own
NOTICE).

Changes from WaypointUI:
- Extracted the settings framework (Setting\*) and its art into a standalone library embedded
  per addon.
- Addon-specific wiring replaced by options (Setting\Setting_Options.lua): frame name prefix,
  title, storage adapter, window position, schema.
- Texture paths are relative to the library's own folder (Setting_Options.Path).
- Added: an own movable settings window next to the Options -> AddOns panel (the same UI, moved
  between them), host detection (Setting.GetHost, "Setting.HostChanged"), the Custom widget type,
  list tabs (Setting\Setting_ListNav.lua), and dropdowns kept above other frames.
- Removed WaypointUI-specific settings and the font preference listener.
- Added a WoW Forever variant of the section box art (Art\Setting\forever).
